# Only what the image build needs: the workspace's pyproject files, uv.lock, the two
# packages' sources and docker/. Everything else stays out of the build context (#120).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!docker/
!packages/climpact/pyproject.toml
!packages/climpact/README.md
!packages/climpact/src/
!packages/climpact-web/pyproject.toml
!packages/climpact-web/README.md
!packages/climpact-web/src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
